    "prompt": {
      "description": "An ordinary line soldier, plainly and symmetrically equipped. A smooth rounded metal skullcap sits low over an oversized head with a hard shadowed brim beneath it, and an open face with two sunken eyes. A padded jack over the torso with plain cloth sleeves, a belt, a short armoured skirt, bare shins and dark boots. Held dead upright beside the body, a plain wooden spear with a small narrow iron head. Both shoulders are level and nothing juts out to either side.",
      "must_include": [
        "a smooth rounded metal skullcap with a hard dark brim beneath it",
        "a flat level shoulder line, bilaterally symmetric",
        "one plain wooden spear held dead vertical and close to the body",
        "a small narrow iron spear head no more than four pixels wide",
        "a short armoured skirt below the belt with bare shins beneath it",
        "two dark sunken eye recesses in an open face"
      ],
      "must_avoid": [
        "banner, flag, pennant, standard or any cloth rectangle",
        "shield of any shape",
        "asymmetric, mismatched or scavenged gear",
        "visor, faceplate, crest or plume",
        "horn, trumpet or any curved object",
        "lamp, torch, candle or visible flame",
        "glow, halo, sparks or rays around any pixel",
        "bright or glowing eyes",
        "white or near-white highlights, specular glints",
        "cape or cloak",
        "large solid black body mass, heavy internal outlining, deep recesses, cast shadow"
      ],
